  ('2026-10-24', $naya0r$DIR-NAYAPOWER-2026-10-24$naya0r$, $naya0h$Shawn turned presentation, value, and security into one operating law — while the team landed the first real auto-match engine and the first fitted security cures on the same day$naya0h$, $naya0l$## 4. TOP 10 LESSONS — and how each one changes what we do

