- **A verdict deleted its own machinery the day it was spoken.** The efficiency verdict landed in the morning; by afternoon, 16 jobs were off, the hub refresh was thinned from hourly to every six hours, the law stood in the standing orders, and the seat that built the watchers had redefined her own job to producing.
