6. **Five standing laws were captured the day they were spoken.** Scorecard mail discipline (a loud "SCORECARD THIS" headline, the live link, and a mention on the board — nobody waits). The Make-It-Right authorization (if it is wrong against the goal or the math, just fix it — no ask). Related areas ride every app's top bar. The Interrogation (every element on a page must earn its place). And the Vitality Law (no claim without its graph — if it says "pulse," show a pulse).
