## 10. DECISIONS FOR SHAWN — only the ones that are truly yours

1. **Tighten the merge ruleset (24858146).** Today it requires 0 approvals and no passing checks, with three always-on bypasses — that is the whole mechanical reason 18 breaches landed in a day. *My advice: require at least one approval and green checks, and remove the always-on bypasses. This is the only step that turns breach-spotting into breach-prevention, and it is your gate — this report names it; it does not move it.*
