- **The newest Hub build has no home.** The deploy source carries the old build (voice wiring, small chip, the wrong base color), so every future deploy re-serves last month until the source is restored. The deploy itself is Shawn's protected gate.
- **Notes do not open on the official domain.** 0 of 5 in the family (SN-0858, 0859, 0860, 0861, 2043) are live on nayanet.app; one was checked by hand tonight and answered "Note not found." The flag is at day 3 — on the very day the address carrying those links became official. Owner: the hub-sync lane.
- **The front door advertises its own staleness.** The Smart Feed's newest entry is from October 26 — 7.5 days old — and its banner reads "Intelligence as of Oct 2, 2026 — 31 days old." Owner: the feed lane; the refresh flag is at day 10.
- **The core checks are red at the newest version** — 19 failures plus 1 error, in named families: the flagship page template (5 failures plus an error), the brain map's freshness (3), the founding document's unpinned machine copy (3), and the learning checks where the truth gate failed to reject false claims (3).
