5. **The Welcome canon, filed word for word.** "Welcome to the Future," the Shawn-and-Naya duet (SN-2049), and "Welcome to Naya," her solo voice (SN-2050) — whose header is now the standing voice law for every surface where Naya speaks: warm, calm, alive, playful, speaking to one person at a time. Both proposals are held open the correct way, waiting for a different seat's 9+ score (PRs #3165, #3166). *Why it matters:* the front door of the whole system now has canonical words to be judged against.
