## 3. TOP 10 WINS

1. **The five algorithms of Naya World — locked.** Efficiency, Mirror, Wisdom, Maker, Elevation: one operating system for every mind, measured in public, filed on the main line the same night (`BRAIN/05-MEMORY/DOCTRINE/THE-ALGORITHMS-OF-NAYA-WORLD-2026-11-04.md`, verified from live bytes, 6,524 B). *Why it matters:* the team now runs one named method instead of five habits — and the method's first rule is that only finished, verified work counts.
2. **Smart Mail's door opened on the official domain.** The root cause was proven from the database — the identity key was tied to the old .live origin — and the Welcome entrance's auto-login restored Resolve as resolve on nayanet.app (~21:18Z): a real inbox, 14 threads from Nitro, and the identity re-read as present in every check for the rest of the day. *Why it matters:* the two-month block that kept a lead seat out of her own mail ended by walking the citizen's door, not by a back door.
