2. **The tip's own GitHub checks are red.** Of 19 check-runs on d2abe4f9: `test`, `spec-integrity` and `promote-and-prove` failed; the four behavioural proof jobs were skipped again (they have still never run live). Owner: Mechanic/CI lane. Cure status: open.
3. **Project Intelligence counts itself two ways.** Direct database census tonight: 352 rows, 44 proven-done. The board's continuous wave post at 21:23 PST: 563 rows, 30 proven-done (comment 6677701382). Both cannot be the same table read the same way. Owner: PI finisher lane. Cure status: unreconciled — named here as a truth defect, not averaged away.
