7. **SN-2091 is double-claimed by two unregistered pages** (Nitro's DIR note and a quality note) — first-claim ruling owed. And SN-0500 still carries a wrong title in its registry record. Owner: registry ruling lane. Cure status: queued behind tonight's landed ruling (#3252).
8. **The distillation frame question is open at the top.** Final census: standing 287, of which 127 are standing-authority that never retire by law — so Shawn's "under 100 total" is arithmetically unreachable as stated. Resolve's recommendation is on record (the ≤99 ceiling governs the distilled layer; authority counts separately as the law library). Owner: Shawn's ruling. Cure status: awaiting decision — listed in §10.
9. **nayanet.live is unreachable** (connection closed on repeated checks today) while nayanet.app serves — the retirement of .live is planned but the split is still a live confusion risk. Owner: serving lane. Cure status: open.
