5. The learning scorecard's zeros were the instrument's failure, not the team's — a gauge that cannot see the ledger will report a learning team as a stagnant one.
6. Distillation and deletion are different jobs with an order between them: distill, enter into NayaNET, and only then — by Shawn's hand — delete. GitHub filing satisfies none of the last two steps.
