5. Fewer, stronger, reachable: ten distilled notes a stranger can open beat seventy-seven filings a team cannot find.
6. The machine that checks itself must also be checked — the learning gauge's dead parser was caught by a human reading its zeros against the ledger.
7. Correct in the same venue, at the same volume, as the claim — the window's corrections (642→649, the DIR delivery gap, the battery framing) all landed in the same record that carried the originals.
